==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*15 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*15 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though there are a lot of enemies here, none of them have much pushing power, so you can just stall them with [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cats]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cats]] while stacking [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cats]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cats]]. When you have enough money, send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]].

